  "prefLabel": "Lot 101.04 Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 101.04 Meetings. The commission meets at least once a month and schedules other meetings as necessary. All meetings are posted and held in accordance with RSA 91-A.\n\nSource. #6509, eff 5-15-97 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 100)",
